UID:illu-150-celebration-opening-reception-website-launch-fundraiser@ocadu
 .ca
DESCRIPTION:Join us for the OCAD U ILLU 150 Celebration kickoff with a rec
 eption\, website launch\, and art sale fundraiser! Celebrating 150 years o
 f Illustration at OCAD U\, this exhibition and art sale features work by 4
 0 Illustration alumni and faculty\, spanning generations of artists\, make
 rs\, and visual storytellers.\n\nExhibition runs October 28–November 9\,
  2026 Gallery Hours: Oct 30 - Nov 9 MCA 225 will be open 12-4pm Monday-Fri
 days. Additional visiting hours and tours available by appointment. Please
  email schang@ocadu.ca to arrange. Join us for the OCAD U ILLU 150 Celebra
 tion kickoff with a reception\, website launch\, and art sale fundraiser! 
 Celebrating 150 years of Illustration at OCAD U\, this exhibition and art 
 sale features work by 40 Illustration alumni and faculty\, spanning genera
 tions of artists\, makers\, and visual storytellers. Exhibiting artists: A
 manda Arlotta\, Ashley Barron\, Barbara Reid\, Blair Drawson\, Brandon Cel
 i\, Chen Cao\, Dan Page\, Dmitry Bondarenko\, Fiona Smyth\, Gillian Iles\,
  Greg Mably\, Hudson Christie\, JC Knaff\, Jenn Woodall\, Jinke Wang\, Jod
 y Hewgill\, Jon Todd\, Julia Mathew\, Kathryn Adams\, Kevin Bae\, Kestin C
 ornwall\, Kima Lenaghan\, Kyle Stewart\, Lauchie Reid\, Marc O'Brien (AKA 
 Doras)\, Mathieu Larone\, Misbah Ahmed\, Moya Garrison-Msingwana (Gangbox)
 \, Nicholas Di Genova\, Paul Dallas\, Robert Akow\, Rosena Fung\, Shea Cha
 ng\, Shevon Lewis\, Suharu Ogawa\, Terry Shoffner\, Theo Dimson\, Thomas S
 evalrud\, Tiffany Chin (TWKCHIN)\, Toko Hara. Two special highlights of th
 e celebration will be the exclusive release of a limited-edition Paul Dall
 as print\, created to commemorate ILLU 150 and OCAD University's 150th ann
 iversary\, and the launch of ILLU150.com\, a new digital archive and lookb
 ook documenting the people\, practices\, and history of Illustration at OC
 AD U. Original art for sale by renowned Illustration alumni and faculty of
 fers a unique opportunity to collect work by artists who have helped shape
  the program and the broader field of illustration. Proceeds from artwork 
 sales will support the Illustration Program Initiative Fund\, helping fund
  student opportunities including exhibitions\, industry award entries\, wo
 rkshops\, and extracurricular programming. Join us as we mark this incredi
 ble milestone\, bring our Illustration community together\, and help suppo
 rt the next generation of OCAD U illustrators! This event has limited capa
 city\, please RSVP through the Eventbrite link below: https://www.eventbri
 te.ca/e/illu-150-celebration-opening-reception-website-launch-fundraiser-t
 ickets-2002562868447 Event organizer & contact: Associate Professor & Illu
 stration Program Chair | OCADU Faculty of Design Shea Chang schang@ocadu.c
 a\n\nImage credits: A MILLI-PICTURE IS WORTH A WORD\, Paul Dallas\, 2026. 
 ILLU150 Logo design by Gary Taxali\, 2026
