DESCRIPTION:OCAD University Senate Meeting\n\nThe next regular meeting of 
 the OCAD University Senate is scheduled to take place on Monday\, October 
 26\, 2026 from 3:15 pm – 5:30 pm EDT. The Senate is responsible for the 
 establishment and regulation of academic policy\, standards and procedures
  at OCAD University. The Senate and its many committees are in charge of a
 ll matters pertaining to OCAD U academic resources\, academic programming\
 , academic strategic planning\, student affairs and any other such matters
  relating to academic issues. More information can be found on the OCAD U 
 Senate webpage . If you would like to attend as a guest\, or if you have a
 ny questions\, please contact David Wagschal\, Quality Assurance Officer &
  Associate Senate Secretary at dwagschal@ocadu.ca . Please note: Requests 
 to attend public meetings must be made at least one business day in advanc
 e of the meeting.
